OL,3,ACapita shares plunge 70% as boss quits 
OL,4,Aafter civil service pensions failure   
OL,6,FShares in outsourcing business Capita  
OL,7,Fhave sunk 70% after its boss stepped   
OL,8,Fdown as the saga over public sector    
OL,9,Fpensions drags on.                     
OL,11,FChief executive Adolfo Hernandez has   
OL,12,Fagreed with the firm's board to leave  
OL,13,Fwith "immediate effect", admitting that
OL,14,Fthe company had "not delivered" for    
OL,15,Fmembers of the UK's Civil Service      
OL,16,Fpension scheme.                        
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
