OL,3,ACapita shares plunge 70% as boss quits 
OL,4,Aafter civil service pensions failure   
OL,6,FThe scheme, which manages the pensions 
OL,7,Fof 1.7 million public sector workers in
OL,8,Fthe UK, has been mired in controversy, 
OL,9,Fwith tens of thousands of retiring     
OL,10,Fcivil servants having faced delays     
OL,11,Freceiving their pension payments.      
OL,13,FCapita has cut its profit forecast,    
OL,14,Fpartly due to the problems surrounding 
OL,15,Fthe scheme, and says it plans to raise 
OL,16,F#190m to bolster its finances.         
